Under Section 68A of the NDPS Act, 1985, Chapter VA applies to:
1. Persons convicted of an NDPS offence punishable with imprisonment for **10 years or more**;
2. Persons convicted of similar offences abroad;
3. Persons subject to detention orders under PIT NDPS Act, 1988;
4. Persons arrested/warranted for offences punishable with imprisonment for 10 years or more;
5. Relatives, associates, and present holders of illegally acquired property.

