- **Stimulants**: Amphetamine, Methamphetamine, MDMA (Ecstasy), Mephedrone (4-MMC), Cathinone, MDPV, Methylone;
- **Sedatives & Benzodiazepines**: Alprazolam, Diazepam, Lorazepam, Nitrazepam, Clonazepam, Clobazam, Chlordiazepoxide, Midazolam, Temazepam, Etizolam, Zolpidem, Methaqualone, Barbital, Phenobarbital;
- **Opioids & Anaesthetics**: Ketamine, Buprenorphine, Pentazocine, Tramadol;
- **Synthetic Cannabinoids**: JWH-018, AM-2201, 5F-APINACA, AB-CHMINACA, ADB-FUBINACA, 5F-MDMB-PINACA.

